                                                    <label opaque="NO" userInteractionEnabled="NO" contentMode="left" horizontalHuggingPriority="251" verticalHuggingPriority="251" textAlignment="natural" lineBreakMode="wordWrap" numberOfLines="0" baselineAdjustment="alignBaselines" adjustsFontSizeToFit="NO" translatesAutoresizingMaskIntoConstraints="NO" id="8X6-aJ-A93">
                                                        <rect key="frame" x="20" y="77.333333333333258" width="321" height="2231.666666666667"/>
                                                        <string key="text">Restaurants, health care stores and other affiliated businesses, in addition to their sole responsibility for the quality, preservation, storage and control of the food and products they sell through Mystery Pot, are also responsible for the accuracy and completeness of any necessary labels and descriptions regarding the ingredients and allergens contained in their menu items.
Mystery Pot does not guarantee that the products sold by partner businesses are allergen-free. If in doubt about allergy warnings, meal content or other product information, the customer should immediately clear this with the store prior to ordering. The store's contact information is displayed on the platform.
In addition, Mystery Pot assumes no responsibility for compliance with applicable laws, including applicable food laws, relating to the manufacture, sale, purchase, storage, preparation, production, processing, labelling, delivery and handling of food unless Mystery Pot is explicitly listed on the platform as the manufacturer or seller of the product.
Mystery Pot is not responsible for non-performance or late performance of obligations related to products, including the manufacture, sale, purchase, storage, preparation, production, processing, labeling, delivery, quality, ingredients, allergens or management of products. We recommend that upon receipt of the order, you carefully check the condition of the products, the intactness of their packaging and their expiration date. In case you find any problem, inform the store.
Customer Reviews
The evaluations made by the customer on the platform for the stores or for the products must not:
Contains defamatory, obscene or offensive material. Promote violence or discrimination. To damage the intellectual property rights of a natural or legal person. violates a legal obligation to a third party (eg duty of confidentiality); encourages illegal activities or invades privacy; Give the impression that they come from the Mystery Pot, or be used to impersonate or falsify your relationship with another person.
Mystery Pot is authorized to remove or modify any review posted, uploaded or transmitted on the Platform at any time if such review violates one or more of the above prohibitions or is otherwise deemed to be abusive.
Ratings on the Platform are provided for informational purposes only and do not constitute any recommendation by Mystery Pot. Reviews reflect the opinions of customers or third parties who have ordered on the platform. Any statements, advice or opinions of such persons are attributed solely to those persons. Accordingly, Mystery Pot disclaims, to the extent permitted by law, all liability for reviews, including but not limited to errors, defamation, obscenity, omissions or falsehoods that the customer may encounter while reading such reviews.
Mystery Pot is authorized to store ratings. The customer does not receive any compensation or benefit for the reviews published on the platform. It may take some time between submitting the review and publishing it.
Mystery Pot Pick-Up Protocol
Mystery Pot customers are hereby informed that their service priority during pick-up is at the sole discretion of the store owner and may not supersede that of the in-store customers present at the time of pick-up. Mystery Pot customers are required to adhere to the store’s ongoing customer service protocol and order of service. The store owner reserves the right to organize the pick-up process as deemed fit and may request Mystery Pot customers to wait until the mystery pot is prepared and ready for collection. Cooperation and courtesy in respecting these terms are expected from all Mystery Pot customers to ensure a harmonious and efficient service experience for all patrons.
Contact
If you have any questions or suggestions, please direct them to the contact address above. The continuous developments in the Internet in general, make it necessary to adjust our rules on network data protection from time to time. We reserve the right of the Company to make any appropriate changes to these rules at any time.</string>
